dialogue joined_ember
title: Red water
trigger: Joined ember
speaker commander $commander
speaker hero $hero

node open commander
  The knight from the Ember sits with their back to the fire, red-and-black armour still on, facing the dark where the Manalith hangs.
  * You fought beside us a long while before you joined. Why now? -> walked
    if: TrustAtLeast $hero 15
  * You've joined the caravan. Before we march, I want to talk. -> signed

node walked hero
  I was waiting to see whether you'd turn and kneel to the thing in the sky. You haven't yet. That's rarer than you think.
  -> rivers

node signed hero
  You fight the Choir. So do we. That's enough of an oath for the Shardfall.
  -> rivers

node rivers hero
  Where I come from we drink from the red rivers under the fallen shards. It burns going down. It's the Manalith's own body, and we take it into ours.
  -> want

node want commander
  The knight's gauntlet tightens on a cup that isn't there.
  * Then tell me what you want. I'd rather know than guess. -> want_truth
    do: AddTrust $hero 6
  * I don't know what the Manalith is. I'm not ready to decide its fate. -> unsure
    do: AddTrust $hero 3
  * Whatever the Ember wants, here you follow my lead. -> lead
    do: AddTrust $hero -5

node want_truth hero
  Most of us want it down. All the way down, broken open, done. I'm still deciding whether I'm most of us.
  -> cult

node unsure hero
  An honest answer. The Shardfall's full of people who decided too early. Some of them are still burning.
  -> cult

node lead hero
  Leaders. The Infernalists have those too. I'll walk behind you, Commander, but I'll keep my own eyes on the sky.
  -> cult

node cult hero
  You should know the Infernalists are Ember too. They'd open the Anchors wide to drag it here. Some of them were my friends.
  -> answer

node answer commander
  Far off over the Shardfall, a red glow pulses once and fades.
  * Then we stop them, and we bring your friends home if we can. -> home
    do: AddTrust $hero 8
  * You chose differently. That's what matters to me. -> chose
    do: AddTrust $hero 6
  * If they come for us, I'll need to know you won't hesitate. -> hesitate
    do: AddTrust $hero 2

node home hero
  Home. I haven't heard anyone say that word kindly in years. My blade's yours, Commander.

node chose hero
  I did choose. Some nights I'm not sure I chose right. Ask me again when we've seen the Shardfall together.

node hesitate hero
  I won't. That's the worst thing about the Ember, Commander. We never hesitate.
